  "description": "Ground station antenna system design: 12 m S-band antennas for near-Earth TT&C, 18 m X-band for higher-rate telemetry, and the 34 m / 70 m beam-waveguide aperture classes used by the Deep Space Network. Covers reflector geometry, beam-waveguide optics, pointing and tracking servos, and the 120-degree longitudinal spacing of DSN complexes for continuous sky coverage.",
